# The admin console.
#
# Lives here on disk for convenience — it is developed against this API and the
# two move together — but it is a separate front end with its own repository.
# Keeping it out of this one means the backend's history stays about the
# backend, and a `git log` is not half npm lockfile churn.
#
#   cd admin && git init
#
# Its origin has to appear in this service's CORS_ORIGINS either way.
/admin/
